tation controllers are advanced wireless gamepads made by Sony to deliver precise input, haptic feedback, and ergonomic comfort for PlayStation 4 and PlayStation 5 consoles.',6500,12,5,'2026-09-27 05:50:55.620','2026-09-27 05:52:43.106','IN_STOCK'),(21,6,9,'Adidas Samba OG Shoes','AS-118','The adidas Samba is a soccer shoe first introduced in 1950, designed for training, futsal and street soccer.',7999,20,5,'2026-09-27 06:01:26.403','2026-09-27 06:05:54.433','IN_STOCK');
